CODEFLUX CHANGE LOG

Purpose
-------
This tracked ledger records completed commit-level outcomes. Every authorized
commit must add one focused entry and carry the matching Change-Log trailer.

Commit binding
--------------
An entry uses a stable Change-ID because a commit cannot contain its own final
hash. The commit message must include:

Change-Log: CL-YYYYMMDD-NNN

Resolve the final commit with:

git log --grep="Change-Log: CL-YYYYMMDD-NNN"

Entry fields
------------
Change-ID:
Date:
Type:
Request-or-TODO:
Outcome:
Affected-behavior:
Compatibility-or-migration:
Verification:
Dev-Log:

Entries
-------
Change-ID: CL-20260730-001
Date: 2026-07-30
Type: Product contract, evaluation fixture, and documentation check
Request-or-TODO: M00-001 through M00-G05
Outcome: Froze the bounded Codeflux prototype contract, objective measurement
  definitions, current-agent baselines, branch authorization gates, one
  independently testable ReserveFlow task, and executable plan traceability
Affected-behavior: Implementation may proceed to M01 only through the declared
  platform, repository, concurrency, authority, acceptance, performance, and
  evaluation boundaries
Compatibility-or-migration: Initial contract; no runtime or schema migration
Verification: Plan trace check passed; evaluator self-containment test passed;
  the independent Task 1 acceptance test is intentionally red against the
  frozen empty ReserveFlow scaffold; all M00 checklist items and gates were
  reviewed against recorded evidence
Dev-Log: DL-20260730-002
